stateDiagram-v2
    state "Under Review" as UnderReview
    state "Waiting User Response" as WaitingUser
    state "Awaiting Internal Response" as AwaitingInternal
    state "Closed — Won't Fix" as WontFix

    [*] --> New
    New --> UnderReview: submitted
    UnderReview --> Open: accept
    UnderReview --> WontFix: reject at triage
    Open --> WaitingUser: ask user
    WaitingUser --> Open: user replied
    Open --> AwaitingInternal: escalate
    AwaitingInternal --> Open: reply received
    Open --> Resolved: fix delivered
    Open --> WontFix: declined
    Resolved --> Open: reopened
    Resolved --> [*]
    WontFix --> [*]
